    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Allen & Jacobs is delighted to present this first floor apartment enjoying spacious accommodation c.68sqm/732sqft which is well proportioned, light filled & presented in excellent condition throughout. This property has many notable features including a separate study, spacious open plan living/dining room, landscaped communal grounds & sit out balcony with lovely vista and sunny south westerly orientation.\n\nIdeally located at the junction of Roebuck Rd. & Mount Anville Rd., the development is nearby to the Deer Park, a lovely, landscaped parkland providing excellent recreational facilities including a tennis club, playground and delightful walking areas in which to enjoy the elevated views over Dublin Bay & the city. Stillorgan, Blackrock and Dundrum centres are all nearby as is local shopping in Mount Merrion. There are a range of excellent schools and colleges within walking and cycling distance, to include Scoil San Treasa, St. Kilian`s German School, Mount Anville Primary & Secondary, Gaelscoil Laighean, Colaiste Iosagain/Colaiste Eoin and Our Lady`s Grove to name but a few. Public transport is complemented by the N11 & M50 being nearby allowing easy access to the city centre and all national routes. UCD is also on its doorstep with its extensive sporting facilities, cafes and woodland walks.\nAccommodation comprises entrance hall, open plan living/dining room, kitchen, double bedroom, study, bathroom and sit out balcony. There is one secure underground designated parking. \n\nAt A Glance: \nPresented in excellent condition \nSecond floor apartment\nLight filled accommodation c.68sqm/732sqft\nSit out balcony with south westerly orientation\nGFCH\nSeparate kitchen\nSecure designated underground parking\nPrivate Gym & Cafe located adjacent to development\nExcellent storage space\nExtensive use of timber laminate flooring\nVideocam entry system\nLift \nAluclad double glazed windows\nLandscaped atrium & central gardens\nSurrounded by all amenities\nClose to QBC on the N11\nEasy reach of M50\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance hall: 3.4m x 1.4m + 3.4m x 1m \nLiving/dining room: 6.9m x 3.8m \nBalcony: 3.1m x 1.9m \nKitchen: 2.4m x 2.2m\nStudy: 2.4m x 2.2m\nBedroom: 4.5m x 3m\nBathroom: 2.2m x 2.2m\n\nService Charge:\nWe have been informed the current service charge is c.3,228 per annum.\n\nOutside\nSit out balcony, landscaped gardens and designated underground parking space (no.85) assessed via electronic gates.\n\nViewing\nStrictly by prior appointment only with sole agents \nAllen & Jacobs (Southside Office) \n107 Fosters Avenue \nMount Merrion, Co. Dublin \nt : 2100360 \ne : info@allenandjacobs.ie"
      },
